<div class="boxe">

<blockquote>
  <p>what is the heck is <strong>HPS engine</strong>:</p>
</blockquote>

<p>HPS is the original engine script name (now rename FMS-engine).<br>
  HPS sinified = <strong>H</strong> <strong>P</strong>roject <strong>S</strong>script <strong>engine</strong><br><br></p>
<p>used as:
  <strong>Funky.mit</strong> : assets/theme etc..
  <strong>HPS engine</strong>: all script and folder
</p>
